OL,5,G0900 The World at War
OL,6,     FWhirlwind: The ultimate guide to
OL,7,     FWorld War II, narrated by Laurence
OL,8,     FOlivier. Bomber Command are unable
OL,9,     Fto hit their targets precisely and
OL,10,     Fattack German cities under cover
OL,11,     Fof darkness.
OL,12,G1000 The World at War
OL,13,     FTough Old Gut: The hugely
OL,14,     Frespected chronology of WWII.
OL,15,     FChurchill described Italy as the
OL,16,     F'soft underbelly of the
OL,17,     Fcrocodile', thinking the Allies
OL,18,     Fcould cut through it to reach
OL,19,     FGermany.
